Package: rebuntu-release
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Rebuntu distribution identity
 Machine-readable and human-facing distribution identity files for
 Rebuntu: /etc/rebuntu-release and /etc/rebuntu-lsb-release. These are
 Rebuntu-specific identity files that do not conflict with the Ubuntu
 base-files package.
